ogre slave driver~
the ogre slave-driver~
A massive, black ogre is here, keeping his slaves in line.
~
This ogre looks a bit bigger than most of the other ones you've seen in your
adventures. His pitch-black skin and bright, orange bumps identify him as part
of the emperor's clan, a previously little-known group. He clearly enjoys his
job as slave-driver, and you notice his evil grin each time he whips one of
his defenseless captives. Though he seems like an ordinary, if large, ogre,
you notice he moves with a feline grace, uncommon to the ogre race.
~
